params.notes:
* '''Jinx's''' ''attack speed cap'' is increased to {{fd|90.0}} for the duration, however this value is already beyond the technical limit for attack speed.
* '''Jinx''' will still trigger ''Get Excited'' from killing a summoned {{ui|Rift Herald}}.
* '''Jinx''' will fail to trigger ''Get Excited'' in the specific circumstance of killing {{ui|Baron Nashor}} while more than ~2500 distance away.{{bug}}

* Toggle abilities do not count as ability activations for the purposes of on-cast effects such as {{tip|Spellblade}} and triggering {{ais|Force Pulse|Kassadin}} passive.
* Despite '''Jinx''' starting the game using {{ai|Pow-Pow|Jinx|''Pow-Pow''}} she doesn't receive any bonus attack speed until ''Switcheroo!'' has been learned.
* {{ai|Fishbones|Jinx|''Fishbones''}} splash damage affects structures (minions will target '''Jinx''') but does not affect targets if '''Jinx's''' attacks are {{tip|block|blocked}}, {{tip|dodge|dodged}}, or {{tip|blind|missed}}.
* {{iis|Runaan's Hurricane}} {{nie|Wind's Fury}} bolts are special-cased to generate one {{ai|Pow-Pow|Jinx|''Pow-Pow''|nolink=true}} stack per enemy hit.
* Each of {{iis|Runaan's Hurricane}} additional bolts apply {{ai|Fishbones|Jinx|Fishbones'}} splash damage, which stacks with each other.
* Both weapons deal {{tip|basic damage}} to their primary target (this includes the increased damage of {{ai|Fishbones|Jinx|''Fishbones''}}), which applies {{sti|{{as|life steal}}}} based on the damage dealt (post-mitigation) as usual.
* The splash damage of {{ai|Fishbones|Jinx|''Fishbones''}} is based on the pre-mitigation damage done to the primary target (which includes critical strikes). It deals {{tip|proc damage}} and thus doesn't apply {{sti|{{as|life steal}}}} or {{tip|on-hit}} effects.
** The splash damage of {{ai|Fishbones|Jinx|''Fishbones''}} will not account for damage modifiers applied to the primary target (e.g. {{iis|Hexoptics C44}} {{nie|Magnification}}).
* {{ais|Fishbones|Jinx}} damage calculations:
** Basic attack damage: {{tt|{{as|110% AD}}|100%{{times}}1.1}}
** Critical strike damage: {{tt|{{as|{{fd|220}}% AD}}|110%{{times}}2}}
** Critical strike damage with {{ii|Infinity Edge}}: {{tt|{{as|{{fd|253}}% AD}}|110%{{times}}(2 + 0.3)}}
** {{iis|Runaan's Hurricane}} bolt damage: {{tt|{{as|66% AD}}|60%{{times}}1.1}}
** Bolt critical strike damage: {{tt|{{as|{{fd|132}}% AD}}|66%{{times}}2}}
** Bolt critical strike damage with {{ii|Infinity Edge}}: {{tt|{{as|{{fd|151.8}}% AD}}|66%{{times}}2.3}}
** Maximum potential damage with {{ii|Runaan's Hurricane}}: {{tt|{{as|{{fd|242}}% AD}}|110% + 66%{{times}}2}}
** Maximum potential critical strike damage with {{ii|Runaan's Hurricane}}: {{tt|{{as|{{fd|484}}% AD}}|(110% + 66%{{times}}2){{times}}2}}
** Maximum potential critical strike damage with {{ii|Runaan's Hurricane}} and {{ii|Infinity Edge}}: {{tt|{{as|{{fd|556.6}}% AD}}|(110% + 66%{{times}}2){{times}}2.3}}
